Package: galaxyxr-mini-tools
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Small tools for the Samsung Galaxy XR
 bdf_mac writes an ath12k board-2.bin for the WCN7850 with the factory MAC.
 map_super maps logical partitions of Android's super with device-mapper.
 panels_off switches off every active CRTC of the DRM devices.
 rpmb reads the UFS RPMB of the headset: its write counter or its data.
 uefivars lists the UEFI variables in a dump of the RPMB or of the
 uefivarstore partition.
 unlock_data unlocks Android's encrypted /data with Samsung's KeyMint TA.
